# Fishcommerce — Full E-Commerce Application

## Phase 0: Project Setup
- [ ] Initialize project (Vite + React)
- [ ] Set up design tokens, CSS variables, Google Fonts
- [ ] Set up routing (React Router)
- [ ] Create global layout (Navbar, Footer)

## Phase 1: Customer-Facing Pages
- [ ] Hero / Landing Page (`/`)
- [ ] Product Catalog Page (`/products`)
- [ ] Product Detail Page (`/products/:id`)
- [ ] Checkout Page (`/checkout`)
- [ ] Order Confirmation Page (`/order-success`)

## Phase 2: Authentication System
- [ ] Login / Sign Up modal/page
- [ ] Guest checkout flow
- [ ] Auth context & state management

## Phase 3: Admin Portal (`/admin/*`)
- [ ] Admin Layout with top-bar notifications & tab navigation
- [ ] Product Management (`/admin/products`) — CRUD table + Add form
- [ ] Pending Orders (`/admin/orders`) — real-time order table with status workflow
- [ ] Order History tab

## Phase 4: Data Layer & State Management
- [ ] Mock data / JSON seed for fish products
- [ ] Cart state (Context or Zustand)
- [ ] Order state & notification system
- [ ] LocalStorage persistence

## Phase 5: Polish & Verification
- [ ] Responsive design (mobile, tablet, desktop)
- [ ] Micro-interactions & animations (hover, transitions, Betta fish animation)
- [ ] Accessibility audit (WCAG contrast)
- [ ] Full flow walkthrough & browser testing
